{"id":"1502062c1b668c4d","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-pi1-formula.md","title":"Pi-1 Formula","display":"df-pi1-formula — Pi-1 Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-pi1-formula","aliases":["88-df-pi1-formula"],"display":"df-pi1-formula — Pi-1 Formula","depends_on":["[[88-df-arithmetical-formula]]","[[88-df-delta0-formula]]","[[88-df-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-pi1-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-pi1-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pi1-formula — Pi-1 Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0084b7b825c6c2d7\" href=\"?note=0084b7b825c6c2d7\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-formula\">88-df-arithmetical-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"12768269414f5f5d\" href=\"?note=12768269414f5f5d\" title=\"88-df-delta0-formula\">88-df-delta0-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}\\)</span> (arithmetic signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0084b7b825c6c2d7\" href=\"?note=0084b7b825c6c2d7\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-formula\">88-df-arithmetical-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithForm}\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithForm}\\)</span> (arithmetical-formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0084b7b825c6c2d7\" href=\"?note=0084b7b825c6c2d7\" title=\"88-df-arithmetical-formula\">88-df-arithmetical-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span> (bounded arithmetical formulas, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"12768269414f5f5d\" href=\"?note=12768269414f5f5d\" title=\"88-df-delta0-formula\">88-df-delta0-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}\\)</span> (arithmetic-variable set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\vec x\\,\\psi\">\\(\\forall\\vec x\\,\\psi\\)</span> (iterated universal prefix; the empty prefix is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^{\\mathrm{fml}}_1\">\\(\\Pi^{\\mathrm{fml}}_1\\)</span> (syntactic class of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> formulas)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pi1\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\Pi^{\\mathrm{fml}}_1\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ArithForm}:\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\exists\\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^{k}\\;\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\Delta_0\\;\n\\bigl(\\varphi=\\forall\\vec x\\,\\psi\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}pi1\\text{-}formula}\\vdash\n\\Pi^{\\mathrm{fml}}_1\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{ArithForm}:\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\exists\\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}^{k}\\;\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\Delta_0\\;\n\\bigl(\\varphi=\\forall\\vec x\\,\\psi\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^{\\mathrm{fml}}_1\">\\(\\Pi^{\\mathrm{fml}}_1\\)</span>明确表示公式类，不与集合层级<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1^0\">\\(\\Pi_1^0\\)</span>混同。</li>\n<li>在标准自然数结构中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>公式定义余可计算可枚举关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>公式是不完备性的核心</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-arithmetical-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0084b7b825c6c2d7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-arithmetical-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-delta0-formula","status":"resolved","id":"12768269414f5f5d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-delta0-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"8fb998e5ff14bea3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-arithmetical-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0084b7b825c6c2d7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}$ (arithmetic signature, see [[88-df-arithmetical-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-arithmetical-formula","status":"resolved","id":"0084b7b825c6c2d7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ArithForm}$ (arithmetical-formula set, see [[88-df-arithmetical-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-delta0-formula","status":"resolved","id":"12768269414f5f5d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Delta_0$ (bounded arithmetical formulas, see [[88-df-delta